      "message": "Then that\u0027s a great find!\n\nI have no problem with the `else` arm, but this `else if` arm doesn\u0027t match your explanation because here the status is success, but you say here is failure.\nWe also need to modify line 263 otherwise this `else if` arm will never be executed since we already return on line 263.\n\nAlso, probably we need to update bluetooth.rs to handle these lines only when we are not failing.\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/rust/linux/stack/src/bluetooth.rs;l\u003d1505-1508;drc\u003d46e869434729c751108247cf031eeb61ce21bc69",
